# Rechecked 2026-08-12 (site contract + audit reform + packaging):
# - Track product source: src/ (incl. src/ui/fluent/, src/core/services/site_contract.py),
#   tests/, scripts/, requirements.txt, naverland-scrapper.spec,
#   docs/ (incl. NAVER_LAND_SURVEY_2026-08-*.md), root product markdown
#   (README.md, PROJECT_AUDIT.md, update_history.md).
# - Ignore generated artifacts: logs/, build/, dist/, data/, caches, Playwright browsers,
#   CodeGraph, agent session dumps, local zips.
# - Agent-only docs (CLAUDE.md / claude.md / gemini.md / AGENTS.md 등) stay untracked
#   (intentionally removed from git history; do not re-add).
# - Do NOT ignore src/ui/fluent/ or product docs under docs/.

